@startuml context-map
title BevTrace - context map (generated)
left to right direction
rectangle iam
rectangle inventory
rectangle dispatch
rectangle traceability
rectangle telemetry
rectangle incident
rectangle analytics
rectangle subscription
analytics --> dispatch : ACL:DispatchContextFacade
analytics --> iam : ACL:IamContextFacade
analytics --> inventory : ACL:InventoryContextFacade
dispatch --> iam : ACL:IamContextFacade
dispatch --> inventory : ACL:InventoryContextFacade
dispatch --> traceability : event:DeliveryConfirmed
incident --> dispatch : event:DispatchAuthorized
incident --> iam : ACL:IamContextFacade
incident --> inventory : event:DiscrepanciesDetected
incident --> telemetry : ACL:TelemetryContextFacade
incident --> traceability : ACL:TraceabilityContextFacade, event:DeliveryConfirmed
inventory --> iam : ACL:IamContextFacade
subscription --> iam : ACL:IamContextFacade
telemetry --> dispatch : ACL:DispatchContextFacade
traceability --> dispatch : event:DispatchDeparted
traceability --> telemetry : ACL:TelemetryContextFacade, event:ReadingRecorded
@enduml
